    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="48.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 48.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he gewyrce þæt man hine afylle ðurh þæt ðe he ongean riht geanbyrde, gif mann þæt gesoðian mage, licge he ǽgylde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he so acts as to bring about his own death by setting himself against the law, no compensation shall be paid for him, if this can be proved.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he gewyrce, þæt man hine afylle, þurh þæt þe he ongean riht geondbyrde, gif man þæt gesoðige, licge ægilde.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
